              "text": "नापास होणे — nāpās hoṇe — \"to fail (an exam)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तो गणितात नापास झाला. to gaṇitāt nāpās jhālā. He failed in maths."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो नापास झाला, to nāpās jhālā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The school subject takes -त: गणितात नापास, failed in maths."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नापास होणे (nāpās hoṇe) joins नापास, a hybrid of the Persian prefix nā-, \"not\", and a loan from English pass, to होणे, \"to become\"."
            }
